| 1 | Navigate to https://www.saucedemo.com/ | Login page displays |
| 2 | Enter Login: locked_out_user| Login appears in field |
| 3 | Enter password: secret_sauce  | Password masked with bullets |
| 4 | Click "Login" button | User should get message "Epic sadface: Sorry, this user has been locked out."|

